  "body": "A large 1282m2 section with Sea Views and subdivision potential.\r\nFreehold and without restrictive covenants.\r\n \r\nGreat location: quiet coastal area, near schools, stunning beaches, shops and cafes, Silverdale town centre, New World Whangaparaoa…\r\n \r\nA short stroll to schools and Stanmore Bay leisure centre, Stanmore Bay beach.\r\nAlso there is a bus stop just above the section for easy commute.\r\n \r\nThe new “Penlink” road is just 2km away from the section and will greatly reduce the travel time to Auckland centre once it is completed in 2028.\r\n \r\nAuckland New Planning rules will allow you to build up to 3 houses on your land and this section definitely has space for this.\r\n \r\nAlso a bonus is a “tiny house” – a very small cabin with kitchenette, toilet and outside shower plus a large deck that can be utilized while you are building your dream home. Or you can easily enclose the deck by building a few new walls (floor and roof are already there) and make it a small 1-bedroom accommodation.\r\n \r\nFibre internet, stormwater, sewer and 3 phase power connection are already on site. Water connection is available from Whangaparaoa rd (see plans).\r\n \r\nPlease drive by and have a look (please park on Whangaparaoa road near the 468 post box, do not drive down the right of way).\r\n \r\nOur family moved to the South Island, so now this fabulous section can become the place for your dream home.",
